  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Response to the 2021 Honiara Civil Unrest</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In November 2021, a period of civil unrest resulted in significant damage to infrastructure across Honiara. Through this investment, Australia provided logistics and procurement support to Solomon Islands to assist with response and recovery from this event.</narrative>
  </description>
